                                                "sense_id": "c7f3c867-17ab-3df9-b6e3-d79651f958de",
                                                "text": "Asked about the most memorable reaction to the meowing he has witnessed, Davis recalled presenting the 1996 erotic drama “Szamanka” with its director, the late Polish filmmaker Andrzej Żuławski."
                                            },
                                            {
